    {
      "source": "Provides a way to completely turn off registration of default HTTP message\nreaders and writers, and instead rely only on the ones provided via\n<a href=\"../CodecConfigurer.html#customCodecs()\"><code>CodecConfigurer.customCodecs()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "提供了一种完全关闭默认 HTTP 消息读取器和写入器注册的方法，转而仅依赖通过 <a href=\"../CodecConfigurer.html#customCodecs()\"><code>CodecConfigurer.customCodecs()</code></a> 提供的那些。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a copy of this <a href=\"../CodecConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>CodecConfigurer</code></a>. The returned clone has its\nown lists of default and custom codecs and generally can be configured\nindependently. Keep in mind however that codec instances (if any are\nconfigured) are themselves not cloned.",
      "translation": "创建此<a href=\"../CodecConfigurer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.codec\"><code>CodecConfigurer</code></a>的副本。返回的克隆体拥有自己的默认和自定义编码器列表，通常可以独立配置。然而请注意，如果已配置了编码器实例，这些实例本身不会被克隆。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Register custom HTTP message readers or writers in addition to the ones\nregistered by default.",
      "translation": "除了默认注册的之外，还可以注册自定义的 HTTP 消息读取器或写入器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Provides a way to customize or replace HTTP message readers and writers\nregistered by default.",
      "translation": "提供自定义或替换默认注册的 HTTP 消息读取器和写入器的方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the configured HTTP message readers.",
      "translation": "获取配置的 HTTP 消息读取器。",
      "count": 2
